# spectral-norm over Linear.Array's loops: each product with A is one array
# generated from its rows, each row an ordered fold over the vector, whose
# bodies only compute; after idr-vectorize the rows compute on the
# target's lanes, each lane summing its row in index order; after
# idr-narrow-lanes every row loop computing 64-bit lanes is the 64-bit
# version beside one computing its index arithmetic in 32 bits.
idr-rc: pure-array-loops
idr-vectorize: vectorized
idr-narrow-lanes: narrowed-lanes
